# Runtime data and secrets anywhere in the tree. Every image builds from the
# repository root, where the plain names above only match top-level folders:
# without these, `COPY open-notebook/ /app/` would put the live databases,
# uploads and .env of the machine that builds into the image.
**/notebook_data
**/surreal_data
**/redis_data
**/pb_data
open-notebook/data
backups
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
